// Ackermann lowering of read-only arrays (include/sea/Expr/Ackermann.hh,
// docs/design/Ackermann.md): read sharing and constraint counts, which arrays
// are kept, aliasing pairs stay unsat, model reconstruction, and a seeded
// random equisatisfiability + model test (Yices, z3).
RUN: sea-ackermann-test | FileCheck %s
REQUIRES: yices
CHECK: test: sharing ok
CHECK: test: leaf ok
CHECK: test: kept ok
CHECK: test: aliasing ok
CHECK: test: model ok
CHECK: test: random ok
CHECK: failures: 0

